 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, my phone said thirty percent.",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 2,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it died.",
   "s": 2.06,
   "e": 2.9,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Out in the snow.",
   "s": 2.96,
   "e": 4.29,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It wasn't dead.",
   "s": 4.58,
   "e": 5.84,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was cold.",
   "s": 5.9,
   "e": 7.09,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Cold and empty are different?",
   "s": 7.28,
   "e": 9.03,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Very. Inside the battery",
   "s": 9.24,
   "e": 11,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "is a liquid,",
   "s": 11.06,
   "e": 11.6,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and tiny lithium bits",
   "s": 11.66,
   "e": 13.2,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "swim through it.",
   "s": 13.26,
   "e": 14.45,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "That swimming is your power.",
   "s": 14.52,
   "e": 16.45,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Swimming. Okay.",
   "s": 16.82,
   "e": 18.35,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now freeze it.",
   "s": 18.52,
   "e": 19.74,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The liquid turns thick,",
   "s": 19.8,
   "e": 20.86,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "like honey.",
   "s": 20.92,
   "e": 21.95,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Honey?",
   "s": 22.2,
   "e": 22.71,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "They still swim.",
   "s": 23.04,
   "e": 24.51,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Just slowly.",
   "s": 24.66,
   "e": 25.73,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The phone wants power now,",
   "s": 26.04,
   "e": 27.54,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and they can't get",
   "s": 27.6,
   "e": 28.48,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "there in time.",
   "s": 28.54,
   "e": 29.49,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So where did the",
   "s": 29.66,
   "e": 30.32,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "thirty percent go?",
   "s": 30.38,
   "e": 31.53,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nowhere. It's stuck in the honey.",
   "s": 31.92,
   "e": 34.04,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then why does the phone quit?",
   "s": 34.1,
   "e": 35.63,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Slow swimmers push weakly.",
   "s": 35.74,
   "e": 37.61,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The voltage sags.",
   "s": 37.8,
   "e": 39.07,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Under a certain line,",
   "s": 39.34,
   "e": 40.69,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the phone shuts itself",
   "s": 40.84,
   "e": 41.68,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "off to stay safe.",
   "s": 41.74,
   "e": 43.1,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "With thirty percent still in there?",
   "s": 43.16,
   "e": 45.29,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Warm it up,",
   "s": 45.6,
   "e": 46.53,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "the honey thins,",
   "s": 46.62,
   "e": 47.18,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and the thirty percent comes back.",
   "s": 47.24,
   "e": 49.41,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Warm it how?",
   "s": 49.66,
   "e": 50.73,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside your coat.",
   "s": 50.96,
   "e": 52.2,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Close to you.",
   "s": 52.26,
   "e": 53.25,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the battery isn't broken.",
   "s": 53.44,
   "e": 55.15,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Just slow.",
   "s": 55.73,
   "e": 56.99,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Like you before breakfast.",
   "s": 57.1,
   "e": 58.85,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
